    "findings": [
      "The virtual-address model allocates illustrative P0-P4 physical pages in narration order. The sixteen virtual regions versus five needed pages are separate quantities and are not an engine benchmark.",
      "Camera movement changes needed addresses: reuse2 and new3 are visible. The light-change model invalidates red-marked pages and redraws them; this is an explanatory cache model, not measured engine cache statistics.",
      "The SMRT model shows five illustrative sampling lines with red3/teal2 grouping, projected top/side faces and occlusion. It describes depth sampling without claiming those screen lines are a real game mesh intersection measurement.",
      "Frames879/1796/2625 preserve the preceding scene; frames880/1797/2626 begin the next scene exactly. Clean black sources have no baked narration-caption boxes. White/gray labels and yellow emphasis are readable."
